---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy - Saver For TUBE"
  description="Exhaustive Privacy Policy for Saver For TUBE explaining our ephemeral in-memory stream processing, zero-storage architecture, GDPR/CCPA compliance, and cookie disclosures."
  canonicalUrl="https://saverfortube.com/privacy-policy"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 sm:py-16 space-y-8">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="space-y-3 text-center sm:text-left">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-950 text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 border border-red-200 dark:border-red-900/60">
        Legal &amp; Compliance Document
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
        Effective / Last Updated: October 2026 &bull; Applies to: https://saverfortube.com
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content Container -->
    <div class="border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900/90 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-10 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 space-y-8 leading-relaxed">
      
      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 font-mono">1.</span> Introduction &amp; Acceptance of Terms
        </h2>
        <p>
          Welcome to <strong>Saver For TUBE</strong> (accessible at <a href="https://saverfortube.com" class="text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 hover:underline">https://saverfortube.com</a>). One of our foremost operational commitments is ensuring the absolute privacy, confidentiality, and data autonomy of every visitor who accesses our web application.
        </p>
        <p>
          This comprehensive Privacy Policy governs the manner in which Saver For TUBE processes technical telemetry, handles transient data streams, interacts with third-party advertising networks, and complies with international privacy frameworks including the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA/CPRA). By accessing, browsing, or utilizing our web-based audio conversion tools, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and consented to the practices described in this document.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 font-mono">2.</span> Ephemeral Processing &amp; Zero Data Storage Architecture
        </h2>
        <p>
          Unlike legacy media downloaders that store and index audio files on persistent web servers, <strong>Saver For TUBE operates strictly on a real-time, in-memory stream demuxing model</strong>:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc list-inside pl-1 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
          <li><strong>No Permanent Media Storage:</strong> We do NOT host, save, cache, archive, or maintain any audio tracks, MP3 files, or video containers on our permanent server disks.</li>
          <li><strong>Immediate Buffer Purging:</strong> When a user inputs a public video link, our transcoding engine extracts the corresponding audio stream in volatile server RAM memory. The moment the user completes their file download, all temporary memory buffers are instantly and irreversibly destroyed.</li>
          <li><strong>No Search History Tracking:</strong> We do not log, catalog, or associate individual conversion queries with specific IP addresses or personal profiles.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 font-mono">3.</span> Personal Data We Do NOT Collect
        </h2>
        <p>
          We adhere strictly to the principle of <em>Data Minimization</em>. To maintain frictionless access and ensure maximum user anonymity, Saver For TUBE enforces the following data non-collection policies:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside pl-1 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
          <li><strong>No User Registration:</strong> You are never required to create an account, register a profile, or provide login credentials.</li>
          <li><strong>No Financial or Payment Data:</strong> Saver For TUBE is completely free. We never request credit card numbers, billing addresses, or banking details.</li>
          <li><strong>No Personally Identifiable Information (PII):</strong> We do not ask for or collect names, personal phone numbers, physical residential addresses, or government identification.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 font-mono">4.</span> Technical Server Logs, Network Telemetry &amp; Performance Analytics
        </h2>
        <p>
          Like all standard cloud-hosted web properties, our infrastructure automatically records non-personally identifiable diagnostic telemetry to safeguard server availability, prevent Distributed Denial of Service (DDoS) abuse, and maintain rapid transcoding throughput:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc list-inside pl-1 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
          <li><strong>Automated Server Telemetry:</strong> Log files may record the visitor's Internet Protocol (IP) address (which is hashed or truncated for anonymity), browser user-agent string, operating system architecture, Internet Service Provider (ISP), referring/exit pages, and date/time stamps.</li>
          <li><strong>Aggregated Analytics:</strong> We may utilize privacy-conscious web analytics tools (such as Google Analytics with IP anonymization enabled) to monitor overall traffic trends, geographical distributions at the country level, and average page rendering speed. These metrics are strictly aggregated and cannot identify individual visitors.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 font-mono">5.</span> Cookies, LocalStorage &amp; Browser Web Storage
        </h2>
        <p>
          A cookie is a small data file stored directly on your computer or mobile device. Saver For TUBE utilizes local client-side browser storage and minimal functional cookies for specific technical purposes:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc list-inside pl-1 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
          <li><strong>User Interface Preferences:</strong> We use browser <code>localStorage</code> (e.g., <code>localStorage.getItem('theme')</code>) to preserve your preferred visual display mode (Dark Mode or Light Mode) across browsing sessions without creating a server profile.</li>
          <li><strong>Strictly Necessary Session Tokens:</strong> Ephemeral session tokens may be used by edge Content Delivery Networks (CDNs) for load balancing and routing conversion traffic to the closest server cluster.</li>
          <li><strong>Managing Cookies:</strong> You can choose to disable or selectively block cookies through your individual browser settings (Chrome, Safari, Firefox, Edge). Note that disabling local storage may cause theme settings to reset upon page refresh.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 6 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 font-mono">6.</span> Third-Party Advertising &amp; Cookie Disclosures (Google AdSense)
        </h2>
        <p>
          To maintain Saver For TUBE as a completely free public service without subscriptions, we may display third-party advertisements served by certified advertising networks, including <strong>Google AdSense</strong>:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc list-inside pl-1 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
          <li><strong>DoubleClick DART Cookies:</strong> Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this website or other websites across the internet.</li>
          <li><strong>Advertising Opt-Out:</strong> Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting Google's official <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 hover:underline">Ads Settings page</a> or by utilizing the Network Advertising Initiative (NAI) opt-out portal at <a href="https://optout.networkadvertising.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 hover:underline">optout.networkadvertising.org</a>. European users may also manage preferences via the European Interactive Digital Advertising Alliance at <a href="https://www.youronlinechoices.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 hover:underline">youronlinechoices.com</a>.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 7 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 font-mono">7.</span> GDPR Compliance Statement (For EEA &amp; UK Users)
        </h2>
        <p>
          For individuals residing within the European Economic Area (EEA), the United Kingdom, and Switzerland, all processing of non-personal technical telemetry is conducted in strict compliance with the General Data Protection Regulation (Regulation (EU) 2016/679 - GDPR):
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc list-inside pl-1 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
          <li><strong>Legal Basis for Processing:</strong> The legitimate interest of Saver For TUBE (Article 6(1)(f) GDPR) to deliver a secure, functional, and optimized web application while preventing abuse and malicious automated traffic.</li>
          <li><strong>Your Data Subject Rights:</strong> You possess the right to request access to, rectification of, restriction of processing, or erasure of any server log entries relating to your IP address, subject to technical feasibility. Inquiries may be addressed to our privacy desk.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 8 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 font-mono">8.</span> CCPA / CPRA Compliance Statement (California Residents)
        </h2>
        <p>
          Under the California Consumer Privacy Act of 2018 (CCPA) and the California Privacy Rights Act (CPRA), California residents are entitled to specific disclosures:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc list-inside pl-1 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
          <li><strong>No Sale or Sharing of Personal Data:</strong> Saver For TUBE has not sold, shared, rented, or leased personal information of any consumer in the preceding 12 months, and will never do so.</li>
          <li><strong>Non-Discrimination:</strong> We do not discriminate against any user who exercises their statutory rights under the CCPA/CPRA. All visitors enjoy full, unrestricted access to our conversion tools regardless of privacy preference settings.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 9 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 font-mono">9.</span> Children's Online Privacy Protection Act (COPPA)
        </h2>
        <p>
          Protecting the privacy of young children is of paramount importance. Saver For TUBE does not knowingly collect, solicit, or maintain personal information from individuals under 13 years of age (or under 16 in applicable European jurisdictions). If you are a parent or guardian and believe that your child has provided us with any identifying data, please contact us immediately, and we will promptly purge such records from our server logs.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 10 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 font-mono">10.</span> Intellectual Property, DMCA &amp; Fair Use Acknowledgment
        </h2>
        <p>
          Saver For TUBE functions solely as a client-side technological tool designed to enable personal fair use, academic research, educational study, and the archiving of public domain or Creative Commons-licensed audio materials. 
        </p>
        <p>
          We respect intellectual property rights and comply fully with the Digital Millennium Copyright Act (DMCA). Because we operate on a zero-storage ephemeral architecture, no audio files are stored on our servers. However, copyright holders may direct any inquiries or notices to our designated legal contact channel.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 11 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 font-mono">11.</span> Data Security &amp; End-to-End Encryption
        </h2>
        <p>
          Saver For TUBE employs industry-standard 256-bit SSL/TLS (Secure Sockets Layer / Transport Layer Security) cryptographic protocols across all endpoints. All transmissions between your web browser and our edge servers are fully encrypted in transit to protect against packet interception, spoofing, and man-in-the-middle attacks.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 12 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 font-mono">12.</span> Policy Updates &amp; Contact Information
        </h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to revise or update this Privacy Policy periodically to reflect changes in technical infrastructure, regulatory standards, or operational enhancements. Any amendments will be published directly on this page with an updated revision date.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you have any questions, concerns, or inquiries regarding this Privacy Policy or our data handling practices, please contact our support desk:
        </p>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-950/60 space-y-1">
          <p class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">Saver For TUBE Privacy &amp; Support Desk</p>
          <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
            Email: <a href="mailto:ravisapps@gmail.com" class="text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 hover:underline">ravisapps@gmail.com</a>
          </p>
          <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
            Contact Form: <a href="/contact" class="text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 hover:underline">https://saverfortube.com/contact</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
